  "details": "If two senders have both saturated a receiver (proximity 1.0), the closest one center-to-center should \"win\" for Advanced Proximity / Material Contact Parameters. Currently, the result is non-deterministic.\n\nPreviously, this order didn't matter, as the result was always 1.0. However, now that additional information comes from the \"nearest\" sender, the selected winner is more important.",
